      "data": {
        "kind": "beat",
        "title": "Told",
        "description": "What {name} might confide in this talk: one thing of their own story, which each talk's prep fills in (its revelation, and its paths: how it shows before it comes out, and what brings it out, as readily as things stand between them). It comes out a piece at a time as the player earns it, in their own words: something shows first, then, asked or picked at, the first of it, then the heart of it, told once. That's as much of their own story as comes out in one talk: once it's out they answer a follow-up or two about it, briefly and in their own way, and the rest of their past waits for another day.",
        "revelation": "The one thing of their own story {name} is keeping back this time (each talk's prep fills it in from their lore: a note they haven't told the player yet).",
